<section id="request-preview" class="page-section cf-request" aria-labelledby="cf-request-title">
  <div class="shell cf-request__layout">
    <div class="cf-request__copy">
      <span class="eyebrow"><span class="i18n-en">Now, let's look at your site</span><span class="i18n-pt">Agora, vamos olhar para o seu site</span></span>
      <h2 id="cf-request-title"><span class="i18n-en">One URL.<br />A useful next step.</span><span class="i18n-pt">Uma URL.<br />Um próximo passo útil.</span></h2>
      <p><span class="i18n-en">Tell us where visitors arrive and what you want them to do. We will review the context and get back to you with the next step.</span><span class="i18n-pt">Conte por onde os visitantes chegam e o que você quer que eles façam. Vamos analisar o contexto e retornar com o próximo passo.</span></p>
      <ol class="cf-request__next">
        <li><span>01</span><span class="i18n-en">Send the URL and the goal.</span><span class="i18n-pt">Envie a URL e o objetivo.</span></li>
        <li><span>02</span><span class="i18n-en">Hear back by email, usually within 24–48 hours on business days.</span><span class="i18n-pt">Receba um retorno por e-mail, normalmente em 24–48 horas nos dias úteis.</span></li>
        <li><span>03</span><span class="i18n-en">Review the proposed priorities, scope and price before approving work.</span><span class="i18n-pt">Revise as prioridades propostas, o escopo e o valor antes de aprovar o trabalho.</span></li>
      </ol>
      <div class="cf-request__scope"><strong><span class="i18n-en">Implementation from £249</span><span class="i18n-pt">Implementação a partir de £249</span></strong><p><span class="i18n-en">The 48-hour implementation window is confirmed with the scope, access requirements and start date. Sending this request does not start paid work.</span><span class="i18n-pt">O prazo de implementação de 48 horas é confirmado com o escopo, os acessos necessários e a data de início. Enviar esta solicitação não inicia um trabalho pago.</span></p></div>
    </div>

    <form id="cf-preview-form" class="cf-lead-form" action="/contact/" method="post">
      <div class="cf-lead-form__heading"><span class="i18n-en">Your 3-point preview starts here</span><span class="i18n-pt">Seu preview de 3 pontos começa aqui</span><span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></div>
      <fieldset data-preview-fields disabled>
        <legend class="cf-sr-only"><span class="i18n-en">Preview request details</span><span class="i18n-pt">Dados para solicitar o preview</span></legend>
        <div class="cf-lead-form__honeypot" aria-hidden="true"><label for="cf-website">Website</label><input id="cf-website" name="website" type="text" tabindex="-1" autocomplete="off" /></div>
        <div class="cf-lead-form__row">
          <label for="cf-name"><span><span class="i18n-en">Your name</span><span class="i18n-pt">Seu nome</span></span><input id="cf-name" name="name" autocomplete="name" maxlength="160" required /></label>
          <label for="cf-email"><span><span class="i18n-en">Email</span><span class="i18n-pt">E-mail</span></span><input id="cf-email" name="email" type="email" autocomplete="email" placeholder="you@company.com" maxlength="220" required /></label>
        </div>
        <label for="cf-site-url"><span><span class="i18n-en">Website URL</span><span class="i18n-pt">URL do site</span></span><input id="cf-site-url" name="site_url" type="url" inputmode="url" autocomplete="url" placeholder="https://your-site.com" maxlength="2048" required /></label>
        <label for="cf-goal"><span><span class="i18n-en">What should the site help people do?</span><span class="i18n-pt">O que o site deve ajudar as pessoas a fazer?</span></span><textarea id="cf-goal" name="goal" rows="3" minlength="10" maxlength="1800" aria-describedby="cf-goal-hint" required></textarea><small id="cf-goal-hint"><span class="i18n-en">For example: book a consultation, ask for a quote, or buy a product.</span><span class="i18n-pt">Por exemplo: agendar uma consulta, pedir um orçamento ou comprar um produto.</span></small></label>
        <button class="button button--gold cf-lead-form__submit" type="submit"><span data-preview-idle><span class="i18n-en">Request my 3-point preview</span><span class="i18n-pt">Pedir meu preview de 3 pontos</span><span aria-hidden="true"> ↗</span></span><span data-preview-loading hidden><span class="i18n-en">Sending your request…</span><span class="i18n-pt">Enviando sua solicitação…</span></span></button>
        <p class="cf-lead-form__privacy"><span class="i18n-en">Your details are used to respond to this enquiry.</span><span class="i18n-pt">Seus dados são usados para responder a esta solicitação.</span> <a href="/privacy/"><span class="i18n-en">Privacy</span><span class="i18n-pt">Privacidade</span></a></p>
      </fieldset>
      <div class="cf-lead-form__error" data-preview-error role="alert" hidden><p><span class="i18n-en">We could not confirm your request. Your details are still here; you can try again or send them by email.</span><span class="i18n-pt">Não conseguimos confirmar sua solicitação. Os dados continuam aqui; você pode tentar novamente ou enviá-los por e-mail.</span></p><a data-preview-email href="mailto:hello@volynx.world"><span class="i18n-en">Send by email instead →</span><span class="i18n-pt">Enviar por e-mail →</span></a></div>
      <div class="cf-lead-form__success" data-preview-success tabindex="-1" role="status" hidden><span aria-hidden="true">✓</span><h3><span class="i18n-en">Your request is with us.</span><span class="i18n-pt">Sua solicitação chegou.</span></h3><p><span class="i18n-en">We will review the site and goal, then reply by email — usually within 24–48 hours on business days.</span><span class="i18n-pt">Vamos revisar o site e o objetivo, e responder por e-mail — normalmente em 24–48 horas nos dias úteis.</span></p></div>
      <noscript><p class="cf-lead-form__noscript"><span class="i18n-en">To request a preview without JavaScript, email your URL and goal to</span><span class="i18n-pt">Para solicitar um preview sem JavaScript, envie sua URL e objetivo para</span> <a href="mailto:hello@volynx.world">hello@volynx.world</a>.</p></noscript>
    </form>
  </div>
</section>

<script>
  import { submitConversionPreview, conversionPreviewMailto } from '../../lib/conversion-preview.js';

  const form = document.querySelector<HTMLFormElement>('#cf-preview-form');
  if (form) {
    const fields = form.querySelector<HTMLFieldSetElement>('[data-preview-fields]')!;
    const button = form.querySelector<HTMLButtonElement>('[type="submit"]')!;
    const idle = form.querySelector<HTMLElement>('[data-preview-idle]')!;
    const loading = form.querySelector<HTMLElement>('[data-preview-loading]')!;
    const error = form.querySelector<HTMLElement>('[data-preview-error]')!;
    const success = form.querySelector<HTMLElement>('[data-preview-success]')!;
    const fallback = form.querySelector<HTMLAnchorElement>('[data-preview-email]')!;
    let sending = false;
    form.addEventListener('submit', async (event) => {
      event.preventDefault();
      if (sending) return;
      const values = new FormData(form);
      const input = {
        name: String(values.get('name') || ''), email: String(values.get('email') || ''),
        siteUrl: String(values.get('site_url') || ''), goal: String(values.get('goal') || ''),
        website: String(values.get('website') || ''),
        sourcePath: window.location.pathname + window.location.search,
        referrer: document.referrer,
        locale: document.documentElement.lang.startsWith('pt') ? 'pt' : 'en',
      };
      sending = true;
      button.disabled = true;
      form.setAttribute('aria-busy', 'true');
      idle.hidden = true;
      loading.hidden = false;
      error.hidden = true;
      try {
        await submitConversionPreview(input);
        fields.hidden = true;
        fields.disabled = true;
        success.hidden = false;
        success.focus();
        const analytics = (window as Window & { VxAnalytics?: { track: (event: string, detail: { label: string }) => void } }).VxAnalytics;
        try { analytics?.track('lead_submitted', { label: 'conversion-fix' }); } catch { /* Analytics must not change a confirmed submission. */ }
      } catch {
        fallback.href = conversionPreviewMailto(input);
        error.hidden = false;
      } finally {
        sending = false;
        button.disabled = false;
        form.removeAttribute('aria-busy');
        idle.hidden = false;
        loading.hidden = true;
      }
    });
    fields.disabled = false;
  }
</script>

<style>
  .cf-request { background: radial-gradient(ellipse at 15% 55%, #8bfaf00b, transparent 50%), #090e18e8; }
  .cf-request__layout { display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) minmax(0, 1fr); gap: clamp(28px, 6vw, 88px); align-items: start; }
  .cf-request__copy h2 { margin: 15px 0 22px; font-size: clamp(2.2rem, 4.5vw, 4.6rem); line-height: 1.03; letter-spacing: -.05em; }
  .cf-request__copy > p { max-width: 460px; color: var(--muted); line-height: 1.75; }
  .cf-request__next { display: grid; gap: 16px; margin: 26px 0; padding: 0; list-style: none; }
  .cf-request__next li { display: flex; gap: 14px; color: #c1cdd8; font-size: .83rem; line-height: 1.7; }
  .cf-request__next li > span:first-child { color: var(--cyan); font-size: .68rem; font-weight: 800; padding-top: 2px; }
  .cf-request__scope { padding-top: 22px; border-top: 1px solid #ffffff24; }
  .cf-request__scope strong { color: var(--gold); font-size: .92rem; }
  .cf-request__scope p { max-width: 470px; color: #a5b5c6; font-size: .76rem; line-height: 1.75; }
  .cf-lead-form { min-width: 0; padding: clamp(22px, 3vw, 38px); border: 1px solid #8bfaf036; border-radius: 24px; background: linear-gradient(145deg, #13242e, #0c1521); box-shadow: 0 24px 75px #0004; }
  .cf-lead-form__heading { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; gap: 18px; margin-bottom: 28px; color: #eff8fa; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; }
  .cf-lead-form__heading > span:last-child { color: var(--cyan); }
  .cf-lead-form fieldset { display: grid; gap: 20px; min-width: 0; margin: 0; padding: 0; border: 0; }
  .cf-lead-form [hidden] { display: none; }
  .cf-lead-form__row { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 16px; }
  .cf-lead-form label { display: grid; gap: 8px; min-width: 0; color: #dce6ee; font-size: .78rem; font-weight: 600; }
  .cf-lead-form input, .cf-lead-form textarea { width: 100%; min-width: 0; padding: 13px 14px; border: 1px solid #ffffff30; border-radius: 9px; color: #eef4fa; background: #050d1699; font-size: .88rem; font-weight: 400; }
  .cf-lead-form textarea { min-height: 100px; resize: vertical; }
  .cf-lead-form input::placeholder { color: #7f94a8; opacity: 1; }
  .cf-lead-form input:focus-visible, .cf-lead-form textarea:focus-visible, .cf-lead-form button:focus-visible, .cf-lead-form a:focus-visible { outline: 2px solid var(--cyan); outline-offset: 3px; }
  .cf-lead-form label small { color: #a5b5c6; font-size: .67rem; font-weight: 400; line-height: 1.65; }
  .cf-lead-form__submit { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; width: 100%; min-height: 52px; cursor: pointer; }
  .cf-lead-form__submit:disabled { opacity: .7; cursor: wait; }
  .cf-lead-form__privacy { margin: -4px 0 0; color: #9bafbf; font-size: .67rem; line-height: 1.7; }
  .cf-lead-form__privacy a { color: #cee9e8; text-decoration: underline; text-underline-offset: 3px; }
  .cf-lead-form__error { margin-top: 20px; padding: 16px; border: 1px solid #e4be8559; border-radius: 10px; color: #f0d6b0; font-size: .8rem; line-height: 1.7; }
  .cf-lead-form__error p { margin: 0 0 10px; }
  .cf-lead-form__error a { text-decoration: underline; }
  .cf-lead-form__success { padding-block: 26px; }
  .cf-lead-form__success > span { color: var(--cyan); font-size: 2.2rem; }
  .cf-lead-form__success h3 { color: #f0f8fa; font-size: 1.7rem; letter-spacing: -.03em; }
  .cf-lead-form__success p { color: #b6c5d2; line-height: 1.75; }
  .cf-lead-form__noscript { color: var(--muted); font-size: .8rem; }
  .cf-sr-only, .cf-lead-form__honeypot { position: absolute; width: 1px; height: 1px; padding: 0; overflow: hidden; clip-path: inset(50%); white-space: nowrap; }
  @media (max-width: 900px) { .cf-request__layout { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }
  @media (max-width: 560px) { .cf-lead-form__row { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }
</style>
